# Product History

Luke Skywalker was first made available through the **Early Bird Certificate Package** before the standard retail release.

Later, it became part of the original "First 12" figures released by Kenner.

> Open Questions:
>
> - Is "Early Bird" a Product Release?
> - Is "First 12" a Collection?
> - Are both simply marketing campaigns?
> - Should these concepts belong to the catalog?

