# Commercial Appearances

The same figure was commercially available through multiple releases.

Known appearances include:

- Early Bird Certificate Package
- Standard Carded Release
- Sears 3-Pack
- Hero Set
- Promotional Multipacks

> Open Questions:
>
> Does the catalog need a Product Release entity?
>
> Can the same Variant belong to multiple Product Releases?
>
> Should Multipacks be independent products?

